{"title":"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Joe and JoAnn each bought 12 ounces of coffee in a 16-ounce cup.  Joe drank 2 ounces of his coffee and then added 2 ounces of cream.  JoAnn added 2 ounces of cream, stirred the coffee well, and then drank 2 ounces.  What is the resulting ratio of the amount of cream in Joe's coffee to that in JoAnn's coffee?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1ff06f16e9f566f67ce8ac681423804c1d340b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A) } \\frac 67 \\qquad \\text {(B) } \\frac {13}{14} \\qquad \\text {(C) } 1 \\qquad \\text {(D) } \\frac {14}{13} \\qquad \\text {(E) } \\frac 76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"363\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Joe has 2 ounces of cream, as stated in the problem.\n</p><p>JoAnn had 14 ounces of liquid, and drank <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23ff72be03eaa06690b47e6349cade434c034e6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of it. Therefore, she drank <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23ff72be03eaa06690b47e6349cade434c034e6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of her cream, leaving her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27ab026182cd2715b1f56aa87c8166f45097881a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2*\\frac{6}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"38\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/9/c1963c119742cb0c9cf75026d9b9938f5fd333c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{2*\\frac{6}{7}}=\\frac{7}{6} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"142\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B\">2006 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12B